## Socket.io Events (Core)

| Event | Dir | Purpose |
|-------|-----|---------|
| join_session | C→S | PIN + team name |
| session_state | S→C | Full game state |
| question_active | S→C | Question, options, timer start |
| submit_answer | C→S | Answer (+ wager if applicable) |
| answer_reveal | S→C | Correct answer, scores |
| scoreboard | S→C | Leaderboard |
| break_start / break_end | S→C | Break state |
| mini_game_start | S→C | Type (horse/card), config |
| mini_game_action | C→S | Bet / card choice |
| host_action | C→S | Next, reveal, pause, etc. |

---

## Data Model (MySQL)

Quiz → Rounds → Questions (optional media: MP3, MP4). Session → Quiz. Team → Session (score, eliminated, wager). Redis: GameState (live state, timer, answers, presence).

