## Design System

Dark theme. Apple-like simplicity. Primary accent color: #6706AB (purple). Smooth animations. Large, clean typography. Figma/HTML for design handoff.

---

## Media & Audio

- **MP3:** Music rounds; venue sound only
- **MP4:** Video questions; venue screen only; no YouTube/Vimeo
- **Timer sound:** All rounds except Music
- No audio on player devices

---

## Edge Cases

All teams wrong (Elimination) → no knockout. All teams answer before timer → auto-reveal. Duplicate team name → reject or append suffix. Reconnection → same PIN + team name. Host manual add/remove/edit teams. First answer final; no speed bonus. Majority tie → define rule (e.g. all +50). No teams in lobby → block Start Game. Wager missed → default 0 or block. Video question → venue only. Late join → persistent QR.

---

## Core Rules

- 2–6 answer options per question (dynamic)
- First answer is final; no speed bonus
- Persistent QR on every venue slide
- Keyboard shortcuts: Space (Next), T (Reveal), P (Pause), S (Leaderboard)
- No slide/question/leaderboard auto-advances without host action
- Browser target: latest Chrome, Safari, Firefox, Edge
